        "created_at": "2018-08-31T08:03:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well ... I don't see this as a 'problem'.</p><p>I was a little surprised when I saw the art but it's not something that will prevent me from sleeping at night or enjoying the game.</p><p>Maybe there was a mistake discovered too late, or maybe lack of time prevented Adam to do the 24 new arts.</p>",
